# ${projectName}

Generated Spring Boot project from template.

## Build & Run

```bash
# Run development server
mvn spring-boot:run

# Build and package
mvn clean package

# Run packaged jar
java -jar target/${projectName}-0.0.1-SNAPSHOT.jar
```

Use `./mvnw` (Unix/Mac) or `mvnw.cmd` (Windows) if Maven is not installed locally.
